      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795070903234,
      "created": 1794325053957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Read paths\nBalance -> authenticated owner -> PRIMARY\n-> Fresh statement snapshot; no stale money cache\nHistory -> PRIMARY initially\n-> Optional replica only for explicitly lag-tolerant history\n-> Cursor (created_at, id) + deterministic descending merge\n\nRedis is not the authoritative balance or a money lock.\nA DB transaction owns atomicity for both wallets.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read paths\nBalance -> authenticated owner -> PRIMARY\n-> Fresh statement snapshot; no stale money cache\nHistory -> PRIMARY initially\n-> Optional replica only for explicitly lag-tolerant history\n-> Cursor (created_at, id) + deterministic descending merge\n\nRedis is not the authoritative balance or a money lock.\nA DB transaction owns atomicity for both wallets.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "Read paths\nBalance -> authenticated owner -> PRIMARY\n-> Fresh statement snapshot; no stale money cache\nHistory -> PRIMARY initially\n-> Optional replica only for explicitly lag-tolerant history\n-> Cursor (created_at, id) + deterministic descending merge\n\nRedis is not the authoritative balance or a money lock.\nA DB transaction owns atomicity for both wallets."
    },
