      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0059",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8141303,
      "version": 1416,
      "versionNonce": 8143098,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795070903234,
      "created": 1794321997362,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One currency for this system: MYR\nMoney = integer minor units (sen), no floats\n\nwallets\n- wallet_id PK, owner_id, currency\n- balance_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- CHECK(balance_minor >= 0)\n\ntransfers\n- id PK, sender_wallet_id FK, recipient_wallet_id FK\n- amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK(amount_minor > 0)\n- currency, status, created_at\n\nledger_entries (immutable)\n- id PK, transfer_id FK, wallet_id FK\n- signed_amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- currency, created_at\n-> Two entries per transfer: -amount / +amount\n-> Same currency; sum = 0, enforced by posting\n   logic + reconciliation, not a row CHECK\n\nidempotency\n- caller, operation, key\n- UNIQUE(caller, operation, key)\n- payload_fingerprint, result / transfer_id\n-> Unique constraint already creates its index\n-> Saved atomically with the money movement\n\nHistory indexes on transfers\n(sender_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n(recipient_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n-> Cursor = (created_at, id), descending merge\n-> Merge sender + recipient streams deterministically\n-> Reject self-transfers; validate all ownership,\n   currency and positive-amount rules in backend",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One currency for this system: MYR\nMoney = integer minor units (sen), no floats\n\nwallets\n- wallet_id PK, owner_id, currency\n- balance_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- CHECK(balance_minor >= 0)\n\ntransfers\n- id PK, sender_wallet_id FK, recipient_wallet_id FK\n- amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK(amount_minor > 0)\n- currency, status, created_at\n\nledger_entries (immutable)\n- id PK, transfer_id FK, wallet_id FK\n- signed_amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- currency, created_at\n-> Two entries per transfer: -amount / +amount\n-> Same currency; sum = 0, enforced by posting\n   logic + reconciliation, not a row CHECK\n\nidempotency\n- caller, operation, key\n- UNIQUE(caller, operation, key)\n- payload_fingerprint, result / transfer_id\n-> Unique constraint already creates its index\n-> Saved atomically with the money movement\n\nHistory indexes on transfers\n(sender_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n(recipient_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n-> Cursor = (created_at, id), descending merge\n-> Merge sender + recipient streams deterministically\n-> Reject self-transfers; validate all ownership,\n   currency and positive-amount rules in backend",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "hasTextLink": false,
      "rawText": "One currency for this system: MYR\nMoney = integer minor units (sen), no floats\n\nwallets\n- wallet_id PK, owner_id, currency\n- balance_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- CHECK(balance_minor >= 0)\n\ntransfers\n- id PK, sender_wallet_id FK, recipient_wallet_id FK\n- amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK(amount_minor > 0)\n- currency, status, created_at\n\nledger_entries (immutable)\n- id PK, transfer_id FK, wallet_id FK\n- signed_amount_minor BIGINT NOT NULL\n- currency, created_at\n-> Two entries per transfer: -amount / +amount\n-> Same currency; sum = 0, enforced by posting\n   logic + reconciliation, not a row CHECK\n\nidempotency\n- caller, operation, key\n- UNIQUE(caller, operation, key)\n- payload_fingerprint, result / transfer_id\n-> Unique constraint already creates its index\n-> Saved atomically with the money movement\n\nHistory indexes on transfers\n(sender_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n(recipient_wallet_id, created_at DESC, id DESC)\n-> Cursor = (created_at, id), descending merge\n-> Merge sender + recipient streams deterministically\n-> Reject self-transfers; validate all ownership,\n   currency and positive-amount rules in backend"
    },
